    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30337" root="علك" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَالِكٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 1; <i>Chewing;</i> &amp;c.]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[The pl.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوَالِكُ</span> is applied by Ru-beh to bitted
mares [as meaning <i>Chewing,</i> or <i>champing the
bits</i>]. (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِكٌ</span>.

